    "keys": [
      "A",
      "D"
    ],
    "rationale": "Both mean the turn has not resolved: `tool_use` requires running the tool and returning a `tool_result`, and `pause_turn` requires appending the response and calling again without a `tool_result`. C is the value that genuinely means finished. B means a stop sequence you configured fired, which is a deliberate stop rather than an unresolved turn.",
