    "rationale": "Cache reads bill at 0.1x input with no accuracy cost, and the prefix is stable and above the 512-token minimum. A trades capability before the free lever is used. B targets output, which is not where this bill lives. C is a deprecated parameter on this model and does not address input cost.",
